  "source_sha256": "c7ee2036bd23f9c1691f3de4525a0b49edaee930352e4e0974c654ef57ab5835",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fbcf312d090a7e83450cf5f16a732aee0136b3bab2b1b101dfb3ba1c8f8fd642",
      "text": "悟空的\n热闹午觉",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "53e8ba525969e920fcf51131ea4a6792e4335144245cf07128d7477a7cf0dfe1",
      "text": "悟空打了个大哈欠。\n“该睡午觉啦！”\n他来到桃树下，凉快极了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "092aa267b0ba777df51787a2160fca1e1d64250279dcf4599d36edfa84b6f024",
      "text": "八戒抱来一个枕头。\n“像云朵一样软！”\n接着，他的肚子\n咕噜咕噜叫。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "70b3bfff20ed26d10e1c76e30a5bc8ff9031d5e9d2d845b8cdf620404eafc301",
      "text": "“先吃点心吧。”悟空说。\n吧唧，吧唧。\n八戒的肚子安静啦。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "30e8d804321a6a6f5dd6ce6f54d82b2db249c15bc30999c7921c49df7782f28c",
      "text": "沙僧拿着大叶子，\n慢慢地扇呀扇。\n叶子蹭到了悟空的鼻子。\n“啊……啊……阿嚏！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "918ec544191d642a39c44d780a6a06372751f351fe9ffb9796236bc2bb7fb0c1",
      "text": "一只小鸟唱起歌。\n“啾啾！啾啾！”\n悟空坐了起来。\n“小声一点，好吗？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c7109d13a33481021233e53a03800ae0b713fe5933f8e8d40055c9e1ba0f1fd0",
      "text": "八戒轻轻地嚼，\n沙僧慢慢地扇，\n小鸟小声唱：“啾……啾……”\n悟空笑了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "526ebb4f3dc0c6ecb45ce7ff7b9d307f072aa213e3c7c46eb2286b2b1106954d",
      "text": "悟空轻轻吹了口气。\n一朵小云绕着他的脚转圈。\n“这下舒服啦。”\n他小声说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "653ec98f8dbbd45bbfed4164ebc51f25890832de24363ff934409842f2d35987",
      "text": "很快，朋友们也困了。\n八戒打起呼噜：“呼噜……”\n悟空忍不住又笑了一声。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "289e068c2785a2a50716093d16c433e502b0dd6baabd8f047b4e750aa8eeb959",
      "text": "桃树下，\n大家都睡着了。\n树叶沙沙轻响，\n云朵慢慢飘过。\n小英雄也得睡午觉呀。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n谢谢你们一起读故事！\n希望你和孩子\n喜欢这次小小的冒险。\n更多免费故事\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh\n免费阅读、下载和打印。\n阅读更多免费故事\n如果你和孩子喜欢这些故事，\n欢迎支持我继续创作。支持完全自愿。\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nPeihong Guo 创作\n这些故事和插画由作者借助 AI 创作，并经过人工编辑。\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · 署名—非商业性使用—禁止演绎\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
